1
00:00:01,542 --> 00:00:04,532
The Vagabond in the Sky

2
00:00:06,237 --> 00:00:08,839
W-What the heck is going on here?!

3
00:00:09,509 --> 00:00:12,250
Have you also been sealed by the Metal Breath?

4
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:13,839
No.

5
00:00:14,339 --> 00:00:16,602
I see you desire freedom too, just like me.

6
00:00:16,602 --> 00:00:17,765
Nice to meet y-

7
00:00:18,547 --> 00:00:20,574
You dare compare me to the likes of you? Don't make me laugh!

8
00:00:20,574 --> 00:00:24,849
I will soon be the king of the Metal Cardbots!

9
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:28,829
I see no reason to fight with an unsealed Metal Cardbot.

10
00:00:28,829 --> 00:00:30,960
I will be back for the Metal Breath.

11
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:31,908
So be prepared!

12
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:35,384
Wait up!

13
00:00:35,886 --> 00:00:37,557
This is all your fault!

14
00:00:37,557 --> 00:00:40,962
You are too weak to be the owner of the Metal Breath!

15
00:00:40,962 --> 00:00:42,981
You're the reason why Blue Cop was defeated!

16
00:00:43,569 --> 00:00:46,250
I think you've gone too far, Wild Guardy.

17
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:46,950
Crest?

18
00:00:51,639 --> 00:00:55,179
Jun. You said the Metal Breath was a token of friendship.

19
00:00:55,179 --> 00:00:56,640
Yes. It is.

20
00:00:56,640 --> 00:01:01,460
If you are truly united in your friendship, you'll be able to seal Fleta Z.

21
00:01:01,460 --> 00:01:03,926
Then, you can prove what you said is true.

22
00:01:05,719 --> 00:01:09,605
Wait up, Crest! I still have questions for you!

23
00:01:10,615 --> 00:01:12,433
What is the deal with that guy?

24
00:01:12,433 --> 00:01:14,914
In any case... what should we do with her?

25
00:01:14,914 --> 00:01:18,554
...Ha, everyone, get in line... I'll sign autographs...

26
00:01:20,798 --> 00:01:23,210
So you're saying you got Vera home safely?

27
00:01:23,210 --> 00:01:26,885
Yeah. She didn't see that much, so I think we can make up an excuse.

28
00:01:26,885 --> 00:01:28,390
And what about Crest?

29
00:01:28,390 --> 00:01:30,400
We still can't reach him.

30
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:33,813
We went to his house, but it seems like he hasn't come home yet.

31
00:01:33,813 --> 00:01:37,751
However... Crest knew all about the Metal Cardbots.

32
00:01:37,751 --> 00:01:38,555
What?

33
00:01:38,555 --> 00:01:40,633
He knew all about them but didn't say anything!

34
00:01:40,633 --> 00:01:42,608
He was mocking us all this time!

35
00:01:42,608 --> 00:01:45,679
We did act like we didn't know either.

36
00:01:45,679 --> 00:01:49,513
I'm sure in time we'll get the chance to talk things out properly.

37
00:01:51,168 --> 00:01:53,456
Jun. The emergency treatments are done.

38
00:01:56,781 --> 00:02:00,200
Everyone was attacked where their defenses were weakest.

39
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:02,655
Does that mean his marksmanship is just that good?

40
00:02:02,655 --> 00:02:05,582
Or maybe he knows all of our weaknesses?!

41
00:02:05,582 --> 00:02:08,373
But wait! We've never even met the guy!

42
00:02:08,373 --> 00:02:10,723
Yeah. I've never seen him before.

43
00:02:10,723 --> 00:02:13,933
Neither have I. But I think I've heard rumors.

44
00:02:13,933 --> 00:02:15,263
What kind of rumors?

45
00:02:15,263 --> 00:02:20,266
Fleta Z. A wandering vagabond, going wherever the wind takes him.

46
00:02:20,266 --> 00:02:22,924
Also known as the Hunter in the Wilds.

47
00:02:22,924 --> 00:02:26,618
I heard he does not like to reveal himself to others, and lives alone,

48
00:02:26,618 --> 00:02:29,569
enjoying the freedom it comes with.

49
00:02:29,682 --> 00:02:33,355
It is said, you should be careful if you suddenly hear the sound of a flute playing.

50
00:02:33,355 --> 00:02:36,663
It means that Fleta Z is aiming at you from afar.

51
00:02:44,383 --> 00:02:46,288
Edo! Don't scare us!

52
00:02:47,296 --> 00:02:50,979
I-I'm sorry. I was wondering if it would sound like this, haha...

53
00:02:50,979 --> 00:02:54,460
Y-you don't think... he could still be lurking somewhere around here?!

54
00:02:54,460 --> 00:02:57,600
He's likely looking for Jun, since he's after the Metal Breath.

55
00:02:57,600 --> 00:03:00,235
But he probably doesn't even know where to find me!

56
00:03:00,235 --> 00:03:03,349
Still, he's sure to try finding Jun through Vera.

57
00:03:03,349 --> 00:03:04,757
Why not call her?

58
00:03:04,757 --> 00:03:07,460
I don't even know her number!

59
00:03:07,460 --> 00:03:08,551
I'll call her right now!

60
00:03:11,258 --> 00:03:12,181
Hello?

61
00:03:12,181 --> 00:03:14,312
Vera? Are you free to talk?

62
00:03:14,312 --> 00:03:15,750
Where are you right now?

63
00:03:15,750 --> 00:03:18,122
Why do you need to know?

64
00:03:18,122 --> 00:03:19,835
Anyway, get this, Anna!

65
00:03:19,835 --> 00:03:22,742
I'm going to meet the person who sent me the email!

66
00:03:22,742 --> 00:03:26,677
They want to hear my full story where we won't be disturbed.

67
00:03:26,677 --> 00:03:29,199
I think she's meeting with Fleta Z again!

68
00:03:29,199 --> 00:03:29,691
What?

69
00:03:30,905 --> 00:03:32,542
Vera! Where are you?!

70
00:03:32,542 --> 00:03:33,531
Is that Jun?

71
00:03:33,531 --> 00:03:37,913
Uh... the park near 7th Avenue. We agreed to meet up here.

72
00:03:38,449 --> 00:03:40,766
No, I don't know why they want to meet here.

73
00:03:42,147 --> 00:03:45,298
They just told me to wait here, so I'm here!

74
00:03:45,771 --> 00:03:47,526
Aah! L-Look at that!

75
00:03:48,146 --> 00:03:51,221
You want me to run away? Why should I do that?

76
00:03:52,923 --> 00:03:53,888
Aah!

77
00:03:55,728 --> 00:03:57,170
W-What's that?!

78
00:03:57,170 --> 00:03:58,260
Run!

79
00:03:59,147 --> 00:04:00,193
W-what's-

80
00:04:00,193 --> 00:04:01,195
Huh?

81
00:04:01,195 --> 00:04:02,495
Sorry to keep you waiting.

82
00:04:02,495 --> 00:04:04,329
Aah! I remember you!

83
00:04:04,329 --> 00:04:07,213
You're the robot that appeared at the bus stop earlier!

84
00:04:10,681 --> 00:04:13,393
Alerting all pedestrians. This is an emergency.

85
00:04:13,393 --> 00:04:15,161
Please evacuate immediately!

86
00:04:15,161 --> 00:04:17,452
Officer, over here! There's a robot-

87
00:04:17,452 --> 00:04:18,906
H-Hey, we need to get out of here!

88
00:04:18,906 --> 00:04:20,182
Get away from that thing!

89
00:04:22,269 --> 00:04:24,286
That's enough, Fleta Z!

90
00:04:26,286 --> 00:04:28,185
We will not let you carry on like this.

91
00:04:28,185 --> 00:04:31,449
I was going to ask Ms. Vera where I might be able to find you.

92
00:04:31,449 --> 00:04:33,908
But I see you showed up before I had to.

93
00:04:33,908 --> 00:04:35,826
Thank you for making this easier.

94
00:04:35,826 --> 00:04:37,090
Keep dreaming!

95
00:04:37,090 --> 00:04:40,480
I'll never let you take the Metal Breath, got that?!

96
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:42,855
Not even if it means your friends getting hurt?!

97
00:04:48,476 --> 00:04:49,886
Metal Breath, pickup!

98
00:04:51,670 --> 00:04:53,149
Phoenix Fire, setup!

99
00:04:54,949 --> 00:04:56,015
Block the arrows with your Water Splash!

100
00:04:56,115 --> 00:04:56,680
Roger that!

101
00:05:05,399 --> 00:05:07,785
What was that? It's a skill I've never seen before.

102
00:05:07,785 --> 00:05:10,310
Fleta Z and the ground are all wet!

103
00:05:10,310 --> 00:05:12,291
Mega Ambler, it's your turn!

104
00:05:12,291 --> 00:05:15,959
Send a Forceps Shock towards the wet ground!

105
00:05:15,959 --> 00:05:16,939
Got it!

106
00:05:18,167 --> 00:05:19,468
Forceps Shock!

107
00:05:23,670 --> 00:05:24,481
We did it!

108
00:05:26,543 --> 00:05:28,947
I have no choice... but to take a strategic retreat!

109
00:05:31,699 --> 00:05:33,812
What? He ran away again!

110
00:05:33,812 --> 00:05:35,242
How strange.

111
00:05:35,242 --> 00:05:36,191
What is it?

112
00:05:36,191 --> 00:05:40,810
He was so cocky before. But so disorganized this time.

113
00:05:42,204 --> 00:05:44,529
Theo? What's up? Is everything okay?

114
00:05:44,529 --> 00:05:46,836
We found out Fleta Z's secret!

115
00:05:46,836 --> 00:05:51,233
Fleta Z analyzed every single Cardbot video that came up on the Internet.

116
00:05:51,233 --> 00:05:54,819
And he wrote comments on all of them!

117
00:05:54,819 --> 00:05:56,435
"Shadow X's weakness is his propeller.

118
00:05:56,435 --> 00:05:59,125
When that is under attack, his mobility decreases."

119
00:05:59,125 --> 00:06:01,732
"Mega Trucker is heavily reliant on his shield.

120
00:06:01,732 --> 00:06:04,697
Aim for his blind spots for an easy win."

121
00:06:04,697 --> 00:06:08,358
Hm. Fleta Z is a strategic type, huh?

122
00:06:08,358 --> 00:06:12,747
He analyzed the opponent first, and only fought when victory was assured.

123
00:06:12,747 --> 00:06:16,562
Hm. I think I know how we can defeat Fleta Z!

124
00:06:16,562 --> 00:06:16,985
Jun!

125
00:06:18,271 --> 00:06:20,908
I know where Fleta Z is!

126
00:06:20,908 --> 00:06:23,144
Alright! Let's go after him right now!

127
00:06:36,230 --> 00:06:38,613
Do you think Jun will be able to do it?

128
00:06:38,613 --> 00:06:40,584
We'll find out soon enough.

129
00:06:45,855 --> 00:06:46,641
Hm?

130
00:06:49,932 --> 00:06:51,856
So you managed to find me.

131
00:06:52,151 --> 00:06:53,942
Fleta Z!

132
00:06:53,942 --> 00:06:58,213
The Metal Breath is not some tool to take away the Metal Cardbots' freedom!

133
00:06:58,213 --> 00:06:59,862
Please listen to me!

134
00:06:59,862 --> 00:07:03,350
It's no use trying to talk. I will not change my mind.

135
00:07:05,100 --> 00:07:07,904
I don't want to have to hurt anyone, either.

136
00:07:07,904 --> 00:07:10,682
Just hand over the Metal Breath, now!

137
00:07:10,682 --> 00:07:13,204
Looks like we have no choice but to fight.

138
00:07:19,535 --> 00:07:22,310
Blue Cop, Burst Shot!

139
00:07:23,141 --> 00:07:24,478
Burst Shot!

140
00:07:28,274 --> 00:07:29,449
Beak Arrow!

141
00:07:29,865 --> 00:07:31,189
Transform into a car and dodge it!

142
00:07:31,189 --> 00:07:31,956
Got it!

143
00:07:39,380 --> 00:07:41,858
How long do you plan to keep this up?

144
00:07:43,608 --> 00:07:46,485
Don't worry! The real battle begins now!

145
00:07:46,485 --> 00:07:47,201
Blue Cop!

146
00:07:53,341 --> 00:07:54,281
Huh?!

147
00:07:54,281 --> 00:07:56,439
Now! Shadow X!

148
00:07:56,439 --> 00:07:57,600
What is this?!

149
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,754
What do you think?! A surprise attack!

150
00:07:58,754 --> 00:08:00,309
Spinning Cutter!

151
00:08:04,230 --> 00:08:05,492
Nice job!

152
00:08:05,492 --> 00:08:07,413
Mega Ambler! Forceps Shock!

153
00:08:08,567 --> 00:08:10,283
I'll make it so you can't use that bow!

154
00:08:10,321 --> 00:08:12,225
Not a chance!

155
00:08:13,386 --> 00:08:14,348
Come back!

156
00:08:16,910 --> 00:08:18,560
Mega Trucker, setup!

157
00:08:19,685 --> 00:08:21,427
Mega Power Tackle!

158
00:08:26,973 --> 00:08:28,819
You have underestimated me for the last time.

159
00:08:29,785 --> 00:08:31,750
Vulture Wings!

160
00:08:40,211 --> 00:08:43,346
Making my analysis useless by quickly swapping each other out,

161
00:08:43,346 --> 00:08:46,344
and fighting in close proximity so I can't use my arrows.

162
00:08:46,344 --> 00:08:48,610
A great strategy indeed.

163
00:08:48,610 --> 00:08:49,700
However.

164
00:08:49,700 --> 00:08:52,630
I am strong even without the pre-analysis or my bow.

165
00:08:52,630 --> 00:08:56,440
Gathering information beforehand is simply because I'm a cautious kind of person.

166
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:58,395
You may be strong.

167
00:08:58,395 --> 00:09:01,429
But, I will never let you take the Metal Breath away!

168
00:09:01,429 --> 00:09:03,542
I see you're a stubborn kind of person.

169
00:09:03,542 --> 00:09:07,587
I became friends with the Metal Cardbots through the Metal Breath!

170
00:09:07,587 --> 00:09:11,855
This is where peaceful coexistence with the people of Earth can start!

171
00:09:11,855 --> 00:09:14,125
That's all very nice to hear,

172
00:09:14,125 --> 00:09:16,232
but you are just controlling them as you please.

173
00:09:16,232 --> 00:09:17,876
I'm not controlling anyone!

174
00:09:17,876 --> 00:09:20,903
We're just working together towards a common goal!

175
00:09:20,903 --> 00:09:25,253
If we work together, we can overcome any obstacle that comes our way!

176
00:09:25,253 --> 00:09:26,921
Now Dexter!

177
00:09:30,326 --> 00:09:32,106
Spear Thrust!

178
00:09:38,650 --> 00:09:40,840
A surprise attack from underground... not bad-

179
00:09:43,413 --> 00:09:45,855
Blue Cop! Let's finish this with maximum power!

180
00:09:52,428 --> 00:09:53,662
Infinity...

181
00:09:53,662 --> 00:09:54,830
Force...

182
00:09:54,830 --> 00:09:56,413
Break!!

183
00:10:07,590 --> 00:10:09,490
Friendship...

184
00:10:09,490 --> 00:10:10,403
Working together...

185
00:10:10,403 --> 00:10:12,336
I'll see if that's true.

186
00:10:16,571 --> 00:10:17,806
Here we go!

187
00:10:19,562 --> 00:10:22,485
Metal Cardbot, Change Up!

188
00:10:42,830 --> 00:10:43,169
Fleta Z...

189
00:10:43,169 --> 00:10:44,269
Sealed!

190
00:10:46,350 --> 00:10:47,352
We did it, Jun!

191
00:10:47,352 --> 00:10:49,331
Yeah! It's all thanks to you!

192
00:10:49,331 --> 00:10:50,830
Hey guys...!

193
00:10:50,830 --> 00:10:54,484
I'm fine over here! Don't worry about me!

194
00:10:54,484 --> 00:10:57,128
Mega Trucker! Are you alright?!

195
00:10:57,128 --> 00:10:59,639
Yeah... I'm okay!

196
00:10:59,639 --> 00:11:01,240
Mega Trucker!!

197
00:11:01,240 --> 00:11:03,678
Don't you think this is proof enough?

198
00:11:03,678 --> 00:11:06,812
That Jun actually has the right to wield the Metal Breath?

199
00:11:06,812 --> 00:11:08,947
I am not ready to accept him.

200
00:11:08,947 --> 00:11:11,659
Haha... you're too unyielding.

201
00:11:11,659 --> 00:11:15,302
Perhaps the time has come for the final judgement,

202
00:11:15,302 --> 00:11:16,383
Jun.

